+# TLS Backend
+
+This project's current recorded decision is to use rustls as the TLS backend, chosen because it is a pure Rust implementation. Two related decisions also stand: certificate verification stays enabled on all builds, including development builds, and HTTPS is enforced everywhere, with no plaintext exception even for internal services.
